,0,4.88],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0608,"r5":0.0364,"r1_spy":-0.0571,"r5_spy":0.0533}}],"quotes":[{"c":"CWST 2018 Q4","e":"cwst","d":"2019-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"We continue to refine contracts that allow us to offtake the commodity risk and pass through higher processing costs through higher tip fees through our third-party volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2018 Q4","e":"cwst","d":"2019-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Edmond R. Coletta","x":"So, if you look at kind of like our price increases, both on the hauling side and on the disposal side, they're really very blended numbers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2019-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ned R. Coletta","x":"But it -- I think it really helps to illustrate the type of discipline we have where we're charging ourselves very high price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/casella-waste-systems-cwst-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2019-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ned R. Coletta","x":"Across the board, some of our peers across the marketplace significantly reduce levels of sludge going into their sites and it's an area that we have a lot of pricing power on today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/casella-waste-systems-cwst-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"…the quarter with a year-over-year improvement in adjusted EBITDA as we continue to make progress restructuring third-party recycling processing contracts to pass commodity risk back to our customers, introducing contamination fees to help drive behavior changes with recycling, and starting two…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/casella-waste-systems-cwst-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"We also reaffirmed our 2019 guidance for revenue, net income, adjusted EBITDA and normalized free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/casella-waste-systems-cwst-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ned R. Coletta","x":"As stated in the press release yesterday afternoon, we reaffirmed our guidance for fiscal year 2019 by estimating results in the following ranges; revenues between $710 million and $725 million; adjusted EBITDA between $152 million and $156 million; and normalized free cash flow between $51…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/casella-waste-systems-cwst-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2019-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ed Johnson","x":"As expected, this is driven by the initial lower margin contribution of the acquisitions and the margin compression of passing through significant disposal and labor cost increases in the collection line of business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2019-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Hoffman","x":"And you go, if that number's greater than what we're charging, we ought to be able to raise price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2019-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Casella","x":"As we continue to make progress restructuring our third-party contracts, we are also focused on enhancing our contamination fee program, which should help drive improved customer behavior with recycling.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2019-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ned Coletta","x":"But as we laid out, we've been able to raise guidance and reaffirm guidance for the year despite something that was unexpected for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Edwin D. Johnson","x":"Last quarter I talked about the initial lower margin contribution of the acquisitions and the margin compression of passing through significant disposal and labor cost increases in the collection line of business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2019 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"We will continue to ensure that we generate an appropriate return on recycling assets as we are focused on recycling -- on restructuring the remaining legacy third-party contracts over time improving our contamination fee program furthering the education of our customer base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2020-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ned R. Coletta","x":"…impact of COVID-19 is somewhat hidden in the year-over-year revenue change for the month of April because of the other positive growth drivers, including our strong positive pricing, new contracts we brought online and, as I just mentioned, 7.2% growth from the rollover impact of acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2020-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tyler Brown","x":"I mean I know the landfill price increase was very strong this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2020-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"As an organization, we have displayed agility in meeting our customers' service and sustainability needs while flexing our costs in an effort to rightsize our operational programs as well as freezing approximately $10 million of discretionary capital expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q1","e":"cwst","d":"2020-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"Our operating teams have been nimble in our response to these service level changes by flexing labor, eliminating overtime, consolidating routes and even parking trucks to rightsize our cost structure quickly to lower revenue levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2020-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Casella","x":"We see the effectiveness of our proactive response to COVID, operational programs, positive pricing improvement within our Resource Solutions business, execution against our acquisition growth strategy and continued capital discipline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q2","e":"cwst","d":"2020-08-04",