t that we enjoyed a very dry summer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"Despite our volume headwind, collection adjusted EBITDA and margin improved year-over-year in the quarter as a result of our pricing programs, rollover effect of acquisitions and our operational initiatives including our heightened focus on rightsizing variable costs to the service levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"We're able to keep track of the revenues on a daily basis and we understand what divisions are flexing up and are going up and down from a revenue standpoint, so we can flex much more quickly in terms of getting the cost out and right sizing the business or the revenues that they actually have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2020-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Edmond R. Coletta","x":"Our increased guidance ranges for the year assume a modestly declining to stable economic environment for remainder of the year as the second wave of COVID is emerging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q3","e":"cwst","d":"2020-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John W. Casella","x":"As Ned reflected in our raised guidance for 2020, we are performing well during these challenging times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/casella-waste-systems-inc-cwst-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CWST 2020 Q4","e":"cwst","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r